Z||000011||nivlek68||08-07-2000||12:11 AM||||gokart the pusher fans mount to the front of the radiator and the pullers mount behind it.ibelive the pusher fan mounted under the scoop would be the one you need. might have to make a braket to mount it though, shouldn't be to hard,and that is a good place to mount it .could use a bigger fan.hope that helps you kelvin||||reg||10
